 "standard_text": "Derivada de una función: tasa de variación, definición, interpretación geométrica, reglas de derivación y recta tangente (resumen de los saberes básicos de Matemáticas I del Bachillerato de Ciencias y Tecnología, Real Decreto 243/2022)",
 "meta_desc": "Fichas de Matemáticas I (1.º de Bachillerato): tasa de variación media, definición de derivada, reglas de derivación, producto, cociente, cadena y recta tangente. 100 ejercicios.",
 "key_big": "f′(a) = pendiente de la tangente",
 "key_sub": "Cadena: f′(g(x)) · g′(x)",
 "body_html": "<h2>Cómo se hace</h2><p>La <b>derivada</b> f′(a) es la pendiente de la recta tangente en x = a: f′(a) = lím<sub>h→0</sub> (f(a + h) − f(a))/h.</p><p>Reglas: (xⁿ)′ = n·xⁿ⁻¹; (eˣ)′ = eˣ; (ln x)′ = 1/x; (sen x)′ = cos x; (cos x)′ = −sen x.</p><p>Producto: (f·g)′ = f′g + fg′. Cociente: (f/g)′ = (f′g − fg′)/g². <b>Cadena</b>: (f(g(x)))′ = f′(g(x)) · g′(x).</p><p>Recta tangente en x = a: y − f(a) = f′(a)(x − a).</p><div class='qfig'><svg data-pf='lg' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 330 260' width='330' height='260' role='img' aria-label='recta tangente a una parábola'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><line x1='34.0' y1='232.0' x2='34.0' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='34.0' y='188.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−3</text><line x1='66.8' y1='232.0' x2='66.8' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='66.8' y='188.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−2</text><line x1='99.5' y1='232.0' x2='99.5' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='99.5' y='188.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−1</text><line x1='132.2' y1='232.0' x2='132.2' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='165.0' y1='232.0' x2='165.0' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='165.0' y='188.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>1</text><line x1='197.8' y1='232.0' x2='197.8' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='197.8' y='188.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>2</text><line x1='230.5' y1='232.0' x2='230.5' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='230.5' y='188.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>3</text><line x1='263.2' y1='232.0' x2='263.2' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='263.2' y='188.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b